pixels were copied. The base atlas and modified composites remain subject to
GPL-2.0. No external logo image was embedded in the generated PNGs.

Application implementation and limitations
------------------------------------------
src/accurate-a330.js is integrated into the simulator. It loads the exterior
AC files and approximates a subset of the FlightGear animations, including
gear, wheels and flaps. Its raw mesh bounds are approximately 63.05 x 16.79 x
59.91 m; these are not manufacturer-certified dimensions.

The model has 14 selectable approximate paints, a freight-only main-deck
door and cabin-window lights at night. The freight door and interior are
illustrative: the underlying airframe remains A330-303, not an A330-200F.
The SF artwork uses versioned `derived/liveries/sf-v2/` resources. Browser
checks covered selected paints, night lights, and both sides of the revised
SF markings; they do not prove every livery or complete motion sequence.

The simulator retains its simplified 747 cockpit and flight model. Do not
present this A330 as a verified A330-200F, a specific real aircraft, or a
complete FlightGear aircraft. Respect the upstream GPL-2.0 distribution
requirements and the separate trademark rights of the depicted airlines.
